WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.004
No agents connected yet.

2
00:00:08.004 --> 00:00:16.007
An agent asks to connect.

3
00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:26.001
You see what it may do, then allow it.

4
00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:34.003
It reads your notes.

5
00:00:34.003 --> 00:00:44.003
It writes one; you see it at once.

6
00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:52.006
Same permissions as you, nothing more.

7
00:00:52.006 --> 00:01:02.008
Every agent you allowed, in one place.

8
00:01:02.008 --> 00:01:09.007
Disconnect it.

9
00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:15.000
Its next call is refused.
